"use strict";(self.webpackChunkauctions_for_woocommerce_doc=self.webpackChunkauctions_for_woocommerce_doc||[]).push([[8123],{5533(s,n,a){a.r(n),a.d(n,{comp:()=>p,data:()=>o});var e=a(641);const t={},p=(0,a(6262).A)(t,[["render",function(s,n){return(0,e.uX)(),(0,e.CE)("div",null,[...n[0]||(n[0]=[(0,e.Fv)('<h1 id="rest-api" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#rest-api"><span>REST API</span></a></h1><p>Auction-specific REST endpoints under <code>/wp-json/wkafw/v1/</code>. Built on the WP REST API and works with standard WordPress authentication.</p><div class="hint-container tip"><p class="hint-container-title">Scope</p><p>Only the endpoints listed below are registered by the plugin. Auction records, their bid sub-resource, and a read-only disputes list are exposed — there are no separate wallet, watchlist, search, user-profile, or reports REST routes.</p></div><h2 id="authentication" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#authentication"><span>Authentication</span></a></h2><p>Public reads (see below) work without authentication. Everything else requires a logged-in WordPress user with the appropriate capability.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Header / param</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cookie + nonce</strong></td><td><code>X-WP-Nonce</code> header</td><td>Front-end JS on the same site.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Application Password</strong></td><td><code>Authorization: Basic &lt;base64(user:app_password)&gt;</code></td><td><strong>Requires HTTPS</strong> — WordPress disables application passwords over plain HTTP.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>JWT</strong> (via a JWT plugin)</td><td><code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code></td><td>Requires a separate JWT auth plugin.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>OAuth 1.0a</strong> (via WooCommerce)</td><td>OAuth-signed request</td><td>Uses WooCommerce REST keys.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="https://developer.wordpress.org/rest-api/using-the-rest-api/authentication/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WP REST API auth docs →</a></p><h2 id="endpoints" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#endpoints"><span>Endpoints</span></a></h2><h3 id="auctions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#auctions"><span>Auctions</span></a></h3><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">GET    /wkafw/v1/auctions                  # list (public: active lots only)</span>\n<span class="line">GET    /wkafw/v1/auctions?status=active    # filter by status</span>\n<span class="line">GET    /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}             # single auction (public)</span>\n<span class="line">POST   /wkafw/v1/auctions                  # create (admin)</span>\n<span class="line">PUT    /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}             # update (admin)</span>\n<span class="line">DELETE /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}             # delete (admin)</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ul><li><strong><code>{id}</code> accepts either the auction row ID or the WooCommerce product ID</strong> — both resolve to the same auction.</li><li><strong>Public read:</strong> unauthenticated callers may list auctions (restricted to <code>status=active</code>) and read a single auction. Authenticated users may query any status.</li><li><strong>Create/update/delete</strong> require a user who can manage auctions (admin).</li></ul><h4 id="sample-auction-response" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#sample-auction-response"><span>Sample auction response</span></a></h4><div class="language-json line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="json"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;id&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">12</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;product_id&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">6311</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;title&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;Webkul Pulse Smartwatch&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;auction_type&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;standard&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;start_price&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">100.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;reserve_price&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">450.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;buy_now_price&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">899.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;current_price&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">100.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;bid_increment&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">25.00</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;increment_type&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;fixed&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;status&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;active&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;start_date&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;2026-09-10 08:00:00&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;end_date&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;2026-09-13 20:00:00&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;anti_snipe_window&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">60</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;anti_snipe_extension&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">120</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;bid_count&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">0</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h4 id="create-an-auction" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#create-an-auction"><span>Create an auction</span></a></h4><div class="language-http line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="http"><pre><code><span class="line">POST /wp-json/wkafw/v1/auctions</span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token header"><span class="token header-name keyword">X-WP-Nonce</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token header-value">&lt;nonce&gt;</span></span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token header"><span class="token header-name keyword">Content-Type</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token header-value">application/json</span></span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token application-json"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;title&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;Vintage Rolex Submariner&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;product_id&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">456</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;auction_type&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;standard&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;start_price&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">1000</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;bid_increment&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">50</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;start_date&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;2026-05-10 00:00:00&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;end_date&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;2026-05-15 18:00:00&quot;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>Returns <code>201 Created</code> with the new auction object. <code>DELETE</code> returns <code>{ &quot;deleted&quot;: true, &quot;id&quot;: 12 }</code>.</p><h3 id="auction-bids" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#auction-bids"><span>Auction bids</span></a></h3><p>Bids are a <strong>sub-resource of an auction</strong> (there is no top-level <code>/bids</code> route).</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">GET    /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}/bids            # bid history for one auction</span>\n<span class="line">GET    /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}/bids?public=1   # public: masked bidder names</span>\n<span class="line">POST   /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}/bids            # place a bid (logged-in)</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h4 id="place-a-bid" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#place-a-bid"><span>Place a bid</span></a></h4><div class="language-http line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="http"><pre><code><span class="line">POST /wp-json/wkafw/v1/auctions/12/bids</span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token header"><span class="token header-name keyword">X-WP-Nonce</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token header-value">&lt;nonce&gt;</span></span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token header"><span class="token header-name keyword">Content-Type</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token header-value">application/json</span></span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token application-json"></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;amount&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">200</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>Response (success):</p><div class="language-json line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="json"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;success&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token boolean">true</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;bid_id&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">4567</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;auction_id&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">12</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;bid_amount&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">200</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;bid_date&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;2026-05-14 15:30:00&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;Bid placed successfully.&quot;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>Response (rejected):</p><div class="language-json line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="json"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;code&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;wkafw_bid_below_increment&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;Bid must be at least $5,550.00&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;data&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token property">&quot;status&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">400</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h3 id="disputes" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#disputes"><span>Disputes</span></a></h3><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">GET    /wkafw/v1/disputes                  # list disputes (admin, read-only)</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="pagination" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#pagination"><span>Pagination</span></a></h2><p>List endpoints support standard WP REST pagination:</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">GET /wkafw/v1/auctions?page=2&amp;per_page=20</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>Response headers:</p><ul><li><code>X-WP-Total: 11</code></li><li><code>X-WP-TotalPages: 6</code></li></ul><p><code>per_page</code> is capped at 100.</p><h2 id="filtering" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#filtering"><span>Filtering</span></a></h2><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">GET /wkafw/v1/auctions?status=active</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><ul><li><code>status</code> — <code>active</code>, <code>scheduled</code>, <code>ended</code>, <code>failed</code>, or <code>paused</code>. Unauthenticated callers are always limited to <code>active</code>.</li></ul><h2 id="errors" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#errors"><span>Errors</span></a></h2><p>Standard WP REST error format:</p><div class="language-json line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="json"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;code&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;wkafw_auction_not_found&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;message&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token string">&quot;Auction not found.&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">  <span class="token property">&quot;data&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token property">&quot;status&quot;</span><span class="token operator">:</span> <span class="token number">404</span> <span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>Common codes:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>HTTP</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>rest_forbidden</code></td><td>401</td><td>Not authenticated / insufficient capability</td></tr><tr><td><code>rest_no_route</code></td><td>404</td><td>No such endpoint</td></tr><tr><td><code>wkafw_auction_not_found</code></td><td>404</td><td>Auction ID doesn&#39;t exist</td></tr><tr><td><code>wkafw_bid_below_increment</code></td><td>400</td><td>Bid amount too low</td></tr><tr><td><code>wkafw_auction_ended</code></td><td>410</td><td>Auction is no longer accepting bids</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="hooks" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#hooks"><span>Hooks</span></a></h2><div class="language-php line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="php"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token comment">// Allow unauthenticated read access to auction/bid read endpoints.</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token function">apply_filters</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;wkafw_rest_public_read&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token variable">$allow</span> <span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span> <span class="token comment">// default true</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>To add your own endpoint, register it normally on <code>rest_api_init</code>:</p><div class="language-php line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="php"><pre><code><span class="line"><span class="token function">add_action</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;rest_api_init&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token keyword">function</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span>\n<span class="line">    <span class="token function">register_rest_route</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;wkafw/v1&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;/my-custom&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token keyword">array</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span></span>\n<span class="line">        <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;methods&#39;</span>             <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;GET&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">        <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;callback&#39;</span>            <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;my_custom_handler&#39;</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">        <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;permission_callback&#39;</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token keyword">fn</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">=&gt;</span> <span class="token function">current_user_can</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span> <span class="token string single-quoted-string">&#39;read&#39;</span> <span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span></span>\n<span class="line">    <span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h2 id="common-questions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#common-questions"><span>Common questions</span></a></h2><p><strong>&quot;Can I list auctions without authentication?&quot;</strong></p><p>Yes — <code>GET /wkafw/v1/auctions</code> is public but returns <code>status=active</code> lots only. To query other statuses, authenticate.</p><p><strong>&quot;How do I get bidding history without an account?&quot;</strong></p><p>Public endpoint: <code>GET /wkafw/v1/auctions/{id}/bids?public=1</code> returns masked bidder names + amounts.</p>',50)])])}]]),o=JSON.parse('{"path":"/rest-api.html","title":"REST API","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Authentication","slug":"authentication","link":"#authentication","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Endpoints","slug":"endpoints","link":"#endpoints","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Auctions","slug":"auctions","link":"#auctions","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Auction bids","slug":"auction-bids","link":"#auction-bids","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Disputes","slug":"disputes","link":"#disputes","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Pagination","slug":"pagination","link":"#pagination","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Filtering","slug":"filtering","link":"#filtering","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Errors","slug":"errors","link":"#errors","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Hooks","slug":"hooks","link":"#hooks","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Common questions","slug":"common-questions","link":"#common-questions","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"rest-api.md"}')}}]);